---
import {
  ATTRIBUTION_URL,
  DESKTOP_GUIDE_URL,
  LICENSE_URL,
  README_URL,
  REPO,
  SERVER_GUIDE_URL,
  WEB_APP_URL,
  url,
} from '../lib/site';

const year = 2026;
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-grid">
    <div class="stack">
      <a class="brand" href={url()}>
        <img src={url('assets/icon-192.png')} width="32" height="32" alt="" />
        <span>Open Record</span>
      </a>
      <p>A listening room for your phone, desktop and web. Free and open source; you run the server.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-fine">
      <ul class="footer-links" aria-label="Project links">
        <li><a href={REPO} rel="noopener">GitHub</a></li>
        <li><a href={README_URL} rel="noopener">README</a></li>
        <li><a href={LICENSE_URL} rel="noopener">MIT license</a></li>
        <li><a href={SERVER_GUIDE_URL} rel="noopener">Server guide</a></li>
        <li><a href={DESKTOP_GUIDE_URL} rel="noopener">Desktop guide</a></li>
        <li><a href={WEB_APP_URL} rel="noopener">Web app</a></li>
        <li><a href={url('faq/')}>FAQ</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Credits: design made with the <a href="https://github.com/nexu-io/open-design" rel="noopener">Open Design</a> app.
        Sample media keep their own licences; see the <a href={ATTRIBUTION_URL} rel="noopener">attribution notes</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Music disclaimer: the author owns no copyrights to music users download and is not responsible for what they choose
        to download. You are responsible for having the rights to any music you download, stream or use.
      </p>
      <p>Not affiliated with Spotify, YouTube, or Google.</p>
      <p>Copyright {year} Ahnaf. Released under the MIT License.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
